1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC, "Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,760
Ms. Zheng.

4
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,400
Did your boss say...

5
00:01:58,401 --> 00:01:59,560
when he'll be finished?

6
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,280
I've been waiting for almost an hour.

7
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:04,000
I'm sorry, Mr. Fu is busy at the training center.

8
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:06,080
It might be some time before he returns.

9
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:08,480
How about you have some tea while you wait?

10
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,160
More tea?

11
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,520
- Fu Ming Yu is seriously sick! - Fu Ming Yu is seriously sick!

12
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,120
An echo?

13
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,440
Who's copying me?

14
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,560
(Episode 9: "Then We're Even")

15
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,280
Fifty.

16
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Thirty.

17
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,120
Twenty.
Retard.

18
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,520
Thank you both for your hard work.

19
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,960
(Hengshi Air)

20
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:49,920
What are the results?

21
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,720
It does indeed overlap...

22
00:03:51,721 --> 00:03:52,799
with Captain Fan's situation.

23
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,840
In terms of timing, there's a seven-minute overlap.

24
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,920
I think Captain Fan did the absolute best she could.

25
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,560
Okay.

26
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,120
I understand the situation.

27
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,600
In that case,

28
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,120
go back and compare...

29
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,336
the flight data once more.

30
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,639
No problem. I'll head out first then.

31
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,680
All right, get back to it.

32
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,200
- Okay. - Goodbye, Mr. Fu.

33
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:19,960
(Ruan Si Xian)

34
00:04:19,961 --> 00:04:21,681
(How about dinner together tomorrow night?)

35
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,400
- What's the status? - Let me give you a report.

36
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:26,519
The relevant leaders and the Safety Committee...

37
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,640
have all been notified.

38
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,879
Also, Director He...

39
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,679
has arranged an impromptu dinner for you tonight.

40
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,080
It's quite a long drive.

41
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,079
Several of Hengshi's core board members...

42
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,239
will be attending.

43
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,799
So you need to head over early to prepare.

44
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,039
Let's head out now.

45
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,759
Also, tell Zheng You An not to wait anymore.

46
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:41,760
Okay.

47
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,679
(Ruan Si Xian)

48
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,680
I'm busy.

49
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,480
- Let's go. - Okay.

50
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,200
Instructor Fang.

51
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,879
You're certainly diligent.

52
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,560
I haven't even had a sip of my coffee yet.

53
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,040
I should let you know.

54
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,559
I saw you have simulator sessions...

55
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,120
scheduled for the next two days, right?

56
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,759
- Yes. - The company has other plans.

57
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,400
All training must be paused for two days.

58
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,840
Why?

59
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,920
Mr. Fu's orders.

60
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,800
Him again.

61
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,840
Come on, let's start.

62
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,600
I'm not drinking this coffee anymore.

63
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,600
So...

64
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,840
It has been almost three hours.

65
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,160
When is he coming back?

66
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,760
Sorry, I was just about to tell you.

67
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,839
Mr. Fu has other arrangements today.

68
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,976
He's not coming back to the office.

69
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,000
He's not coming back?
No, he's not.

70
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,280
Thank you.

71
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,160
Who does this?

72
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,079
You're welcome to visit our school again.

73
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,719
- Thank you for the hospitality. - One by one, please.

74
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,720
Thank you for your hard work.

75
00:06:06,721 --> 00:06:08,920
Actually, we can find a place to grab a bite later.

76
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,400
Then you can ask me any questions you have.

77
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,519
- Is that okay? - Great! Sounds good.

78
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,719
- Where are we eating? - Will it be too expensive?

79
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,919
Just right by the entrance.

80
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,079
- Let's find a good place, okay? - Sure.

81
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,679
I know a hot pot restaurant nearby that's really delicious.

82
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,959
- No problem. - That's the one, then.

83
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,000
- Okay. - Captain Yue.

84
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,800
Excuse me.

85
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,919
Mr. Xie, thank you so much.

86
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,359
The students were very enthusiastic.

87
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,519
It's thanks to the school's support. I'm truly grateful.

88
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:30,096
Thank you for your hard work, Captain Yue.

89
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,880
Actually, I wanted to ask you about someone.

90
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,160
Go ahead.

91
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,000
It's the person you just mentioned,

92
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,440
Ruan Si Xian.

93
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:41,960
You...

94
00:06:41,961 --> 00:06:43,120
We were classmates before.

95
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,800
Okay.

96
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:54,640
- Fu Ming Yu is seriously sick! - Fu Ming Yu is seriously sick!

97
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,240
An echo?

98
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,560
Who's copying me?

99
00:06:58,561 --> 00:07:00,280
I've really put up with him for too long.

100
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,880
He even stood me up today.

101
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,881
Come out tonight. I'll tell you all about it over drinks.

102
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,760
Why are you going to Manchester?

103
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,440
Fine, I'm hanging up then.

104
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,080
I didn't mean to eavesdrop.

105
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,159
It's just that your cursing...

106
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,480
was really loud just now.

107
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:37,120
So what if you heard it?

108
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:40,200
It's not like you'll go and snitch.

109
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,640
I was just wondering...

110
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,400
who would dare to say such a thing...

111
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,280
on Fu Ming Yu's turf.

112
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,840
The honest truth.

113
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,480
Exactly!

114
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,360
I can tell you hate Fu Ming Yu too.

115
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,680
Come on. Let's go for a drink tonight.

116
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,880
It's rare to find someone else who hates Fu Ming Yu.

117
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,480
I'll pass on the drinks.

118
00:07:59,481 --> 00:08:00,761
I have to meet a friend tonight.

119
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,320
A boyfriend?

120
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,600
No.

121
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,216
Then let's all get to know each other.

122
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,240
The more, the merrier. It's my treat.

123
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,760
I really can't.

124
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,560
Besides, I can't drink while on duty.

125
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,600
Right, you're a pilot.

126
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,080
Then you can just drink water.

127
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,159
Let's go. I'm very easy to get along with.

128
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,160
- No, I really... - Let's go out for a drink tonight.

129
00:08:17,161 --> 00:08:19,361
- I really can't drink. - We'll just chat. Relax a bit.

130
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,080
Sorry.

131
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,279
- Captain Yue. - I'm late.

132
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,600
- Captain Yue. - Sorry, everyone.

133
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,239
I had to change out of my uniform, so I got a bit delayed.

134
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,440
I'm really sorry.

135
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,719
- Please take the head of the table. - No.

136
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,320
Come on. Quick, sit down.

137
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,239
Students, let me tell you.

138
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,959
When we're eating like this, we're like friends.

139
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,200
Really, it's not like when we were in that lecture hall.

140
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,040
After you graduate, we might even be colleagues.

141
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,280
At the very most,

142
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,096
I'll be mentoring a newcomer.

143
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,639
You might call me "Master", but that's about it.

144
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:49,960
Then we'll call you Master now.

145
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,679
- Hello, Master! - Hello, Master!

146
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:53,120
No, there's no need for that.

147
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,439
The reason I gathered everyone here today...

148
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:58,039
is because I felt you all had many questions earlier,

149
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,959
but due to limited time, you didn't get to ask them.

150
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,160
- Yes. - Right.

151
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,679
So I thought...

152
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:05,040
we could all talk over some drinks.

153
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,160
- All right. - Sure.

154
00:09:06,161 --> 00:09:07,481
So did you guys order any drinks?

155
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,759
- No. - No, we haven't.

156
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,479
Okay, I knew it. I'll go get some.

157
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,480
Just sit here for a bit.
- Okay. - Okay.

158
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:19,960
What are you doing here?
Stealing your recruits.

159
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,776
I was afraid that if I waited until after your presentation,

160
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:26,160
the pretty juniors would've been snatched up by Flight Ops.

161
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,120
I knew it.

162
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,280
Such excellent prospects for the cabin crew.

163
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:36,640
Hi, everyone. I'm Jiang Zi Yue, a purser at Hengshi.

164
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,280
You can call me Zi Yue.

165
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,520
Hello, Zi Yue.

166
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,840
Why don't you chat with the students?

167
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,160
I'll go order the drinks.

168
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,640
He's the one...

169
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:53,360
who invited me back for the shoot.

170
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,120
And then?

171
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,680
Every time,

172
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,039
and I mean every single time,

173
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,040
he's never satisfied!

174
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
Fine.

175
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,800
If he's not satisfied, I'll redo it.

176
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,760
For this proposal,

177
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,960
I pulled several all-nighters...

178
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,600
and waited for him all afternoon.

179
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:13,920
And the result?

180
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,800
He didn't even give it a glance.

181
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,200
I...

182
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,520
Please enjoy.

183
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,320
I just don't understand.

184
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,200
How can someone...

185
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,000
get more obnoxious as he grows up?

186
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,240
More obnoxious as he grows up.

187
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:35,480
You have to follow him every day. It's truly a raw deal.

188
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,159
I'm going to the restroom.

189
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:39,240
Take it easy on the drinks.

190
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,960
Slow down.

191
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,480
I'll be right back. Right back.

192
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,040
Why are you hanging out with her?

193
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,439
I don't know.

194
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,760
I'm so annoyed.

195
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,360
On my way to the office today,

196
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:56,296
I ran into her, and she insisted on dragging me out for drinks.

197
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,880
I turned her down a dozen times.

198
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,920
In the end, she still won.

199
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,720
Does she know who you are?

200
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,080
Of course not.

201
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:06,800
That's good then.

202
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,040
So...

203
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,879
does your mom still send you money every month?

204
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,480
Once every two or three months.

205
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,520
But I haven't touched that card.

206
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,720
I haven't even checked it.

207
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:18,080
So what is...

208
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,720
your stance now?

209
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,280
Are you ready to patch things up?

210
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:22,920
Or...

211
00:11:22,921 --> 00:11:24,161
I'm not talking about this now.

212
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,800
The most important thing now is to get her out of here.

213
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,160
Go. Watch her.

214
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,360
Wake up.

215
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,840
Zheng You An.

216
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:54,160
You're so drunk.

217
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,879
(Release to send)

218
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:01,880
Come find me.

219
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,839
(Ruan Si Xian)

220
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,840
Come find me.

221
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,040
Go to Fly Hub.

222
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,040
- That hurts. - What are you doing?

223
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,040
Helping you take care of your friend.

224
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,240
No need. We're leaving.

225
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,640
Don't go.

226
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,880
It's still early.

227
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,520
Why is your friend so drunk?

228
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:37,160
I'll tell you why.

229
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:39,560
Today,

230
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,320
she broke a man's leg.

231
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,840
She's going to jail.

232
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,760
She's here to drown her sorrows.

233
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:47,839
You're quite the joker, beautiful.

234
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,840
I'm not joking.

235
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,096
When it comes to beating people up,

236
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,400
I have more experience than her.

237
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:53,960
Want to find out for yourself?

238
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:55,920
No, thanks.

239
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,000
I'm leaving.

240
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:58,040
Bye.

241
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,359
I don't understand what you're so angry about.

242
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,520
Can you keep your voice down?

243
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,599
I'm only here for tomorrow's presentation.

244
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,079
Jiang Zi Yue, I think the two of us should stop beating around the bush.

245
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,319
You should be more upfront.

246
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,320
After we got back from Australia,

247
00:13:16,321 --> 00:13:18,400
you told me we were officially dating.

248
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,799
I can understand keeping it private,

249
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,039
but why act like you're single?

250
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,840
How I present myself is my personal business.

251
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:26,360
Well, a lot of things are my personal business too.

252
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,600
Does that mean I can say whatever I want?

253
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,240
Captain Yue.

254
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,360
Yes, you're right.

255
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,760
I was wrong.

256
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,040
What were you wrong about?

257
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,800
I should have considered your feelings.

258
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,640
Right?

259
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,799
But you saw it yourself.

260
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:55,439
Just now, including me, there were 12 people.

261
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,639
Eight guys and four girls.

262
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,320
What could I have possibly done? Right?

263
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,320
Fine.

264
00:14:01,321 --> 00:14:02,639
Just treat me like a child.

265
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:03,680
I'm just being rebellious.

266
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,440
Then why were you so mean to me?

267
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:07,800
I...

268
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:10,720
I'm sorry.

269
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,600
Let's go.

270
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,840
Mr. Fu, you came. They're inside.

271
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,520
- Okay, thank you. - No problem.

272
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,640
Do you want a drink?

273
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:38,800
No.

274
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,800
She's the one who wants to drink.

275
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,400
So it's because of her...

276
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,120
that you called me here?

277
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,320
Why else?

278
00:14:52,321 --> 00:14:54,000
She's drinking because of you.

279
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,400
Hurry up and take her away.

280
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,016
I'm exhausted and want to go home to sleep.

281
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:59,400
Why do you say it's because of me?

282
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,720
She said so herself.

283
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,559
You angered her to tears, so you deal with it.

284
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,759
I've made many women cry.

285
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,520
Do I have to apologize to every one of them?

286
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,600
That's not what I meant.

287
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Don't touch me.

288
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,520
I have my own driver!

289
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,200
I'm cutting all ties with you!

290
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,440
From now on,

291
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,680
you go your way,

292
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,400
and I'll go mine.

293
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:29,880
Wait, no.

294
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:31,920
I'll take the high road,

295
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:33,760
and you take the narrow bridge.

296
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,880
You don't think everyone in the world...

297
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:37,879
likes you, do you?

298
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:39,360
You're really full of yourself.

299
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,720
In this world,

300
00:15:40,721 --> 00:15:42,001
plenty of people don't like you!

301
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,199
So many people don't like you!

302
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,919
See her home safely. Let me know when she's there.

303
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:45,920
Yes, sir.

304
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,800
Don't let her get out halfway.

305
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,640
- Understood, Mr. Fu. - Go on.

306
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,240
Hey, beautiful.

307
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:05,520
Your friend is gone.

308
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:06,960
Go away. Don't bother me.

309
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,320
If you're upset, you should drink more.

310
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:13,120
I can't stand to see a beautiful woman looking so sad.

311
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,640
Come on. Today, let's blow off some steam.

312
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:19,880
Let's drink until we drop!

313
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,400
I'm warning you.

314
00:16:21,401 --> 00:16:23,319
If you touch me again, I'll slap you!

315
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,320
Sir.

316
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:25,520
Are you drunk?

317
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:26,920
Do you want me to take you...

318
00:16:26,921 --> 00:16:28,336
to the police station nearby to cool off?

319
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,480
It's not far, just up ahead.

320
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:30,560
No.

321
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:32,280
Fine.

322
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,080
Today, for the sake of the beautiful boss...

323
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:35,760
Next time.

324
00:16:35,761 --> 00:16:37,576
Next time, beautiful, we must exchange WeChat info.

325
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,760
Next time? Exchange WeChat? Get lost!

326
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,760
What a piece of work.

327
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:47,040
- Are you okay? - I'm fine. What could be wrong?

328
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,480
Did Fu Ming Yu leave?

329
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,480
I told him to take Zheng You An home.

330
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,520
You let him take another woman home?

331
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:54,760
You're so open-minded.

332
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:57,040
Why not? What does it have to do with me?

333
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,400
You let him take another woman home,

334
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,040
and you say it's none of your business?

335
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:25,560
Oh dear.

336
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:28,080
I'll get him some ice for his face.

337
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,320
Tong Le!

338
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,440
Quick, get ice!

339
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,160
Do you feel better now?

340
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:50,440
I do.

341
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,720
Good.

342
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:53,160
It's time to go home.

343
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,480
I'll take you.

344
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,720
Was my slap that strong?

345
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:26,760
Is it that funny?

346
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,040
Why are you looking at your hand?

347
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,080
My hand...

348
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,720
hurts.

349
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,120
Maybe "Captain" Ruan doesn't know...

350
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,960
that force is reciprocal.

351
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,240
Get in.

352
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,040
Goodbye, Mr. Fu.

353
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:13,520
Really?

354
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:14,720
Ruan Ruan slapped him?

355
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:18,080
Great.

356
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,040
That was a good slap.

357
00:20:20,041 --> 00:20:21,480
So Ruan Ruan is no longer angry.

358
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,840
But won't Fu Ming Yu be angry?

359
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:26,639
If you were slapped for no reason, wouldn't you be angry?

360
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:29,320
What's more, he's the high and mighty Mr. Fu.

361
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:33,440
What should we do?

362
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,680
Now that he's angry,

363
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,040
will he settle old scores...

364
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:37,720
and make us pay for the car repairs?

365
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,920
Stop right there.

366
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Stop saying "us".

367
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:41,536
I wasn't the one who hit his car,

368
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:43,040
and I wasn't the one who slapped him.

369
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:45,520
Xuan,

370
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,800
you can't just leave me to die.

371
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,799
Stop bothering me.

372
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:51,000
I'm doing the accounts.

373
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,160
Wait, that's not right.

374
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:58,360
Ruan Ruan was the one who slapped him.

375
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:00,280
Fighting is a sign of affection.

376
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:03,280
Maybe that slap will actually...

377
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:04,520
bring them together.

378
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,880
Unless...

379
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:07,880
this Fu Ming Yu...

380
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:10,480
has Stockholm...

381
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,160
syndrome.

382
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:45,480
Here to see the patient?

383
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:48,800
Here, take this.

384
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:50,280
It'll be much better tomorrow.

385
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:52,320
What's this?
Repair serum.

386
00:21:53,320 --> 00:21:54,320
It's very effective.

387
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,160
I don't need that.

388
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:01,479
It really works.

389
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:02,480
I use it all the time.

390
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,240
Do you get slapped often?

391
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:05,560
No.

392
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:08,456
The high-altitude UV rays are intense on some flight routes.

393
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:10,680
My face gets red and irritated, so I use it frequently.

394
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:20,280
Then apply it for me.

395
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:47,640
Does it hurt?

396
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:49,800
What?

397
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,240
Are you worried about me?

398
00:22:51,241 --> 00:22:52,320
Who's worried?

399
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,520
I was just thinking...

400
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,320
I don't have super strength,

401
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,320
so how did I hit you so hard?

402
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,960
Is it hot in here?

403
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:24,600
Why is your face so red?

404
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:28,640
Are you applying medicine,

405
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,560
or are you just caressing me?

406
00:23:32,360 --> 00:23:33,360
What do you think?

407
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:36,080
Are you even a woman?

408
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,520
If I were a man,

409
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:39,239
and I slapped you like that,

410
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:41,240
I probably would have knocked your brains out.

411
00:23:44,280 --> 00:23:45,280
If you were a man,

412
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,960
would I have been so indulgent?

413
00:23:59,320 --> 00:24:00,320
Anyway...

414
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:02,400
I'm sorry.

415
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:05,759
I mistook you for a creep today,

416
00:24:05,760 --> 00:24:07,920
so I hit you a bit too hard.

417
00:24:09,080 --> 00:24:10,080
Bear with me.

418
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,120
Let's just say...

419
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:12,480
we're even now.

420
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,160
We can't be even.

421
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,479
Fu Ming Yu...

422
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,920
doesn't seem like such a petty person.

423
00:24:27,600 --> 00:24:28,839
I'm just praying...

424
00:24:28,840 --> 00:24:29,840
that he's magnanimous.

425
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:33,160
As long as he doesn't make me pay for those car repairs,

426
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,320
if Ruan Ruan loses her job,

427
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:36,240
I'm willing to give her...

428
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,960
2,000 yuan a month for her living expenses...

429
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,560
until she finds another job.

430
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,800
2,000 yuan?

431
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:44,120
You're so generous.

432
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:46,600
I never would have guessed.

433
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:48,000
But with your salary,

434
00:24:48,280 --> 00:24:49,720
is it even enough for your car loan?

435
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,640
Then what should we do?

436
00:24:53,040 --> 00:24:54,399
Have you ever seen an employee...

437
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:57,000
hit their boss and get away with it?

438
00:24:57,840 --> 00:24:59,839
Stop being more worried than the person involved.

439
00:24:59,840 --> 00:25:01,280
Ruan Ruan hasn't even said anything.

440
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:03,400
Yeah, she didn't say anything.

441
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:04,896
But didn't you say it yourself?

442
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,640
She looked totally dejected when she left.

443
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:07,920
She was dejected,

444
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:10,400
but then she started laughing.

445
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,040
She even laughed out loud.

446
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:14,600
She laughed?

447
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:17,880
Three years ago,

448
00:25:19,120 --> 00:25:20,120
I misunderstood you.

449
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:22,640
And I said a lot of nasty things.

450
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,816
I don't want to be Hengshi's flight attendant anymore.

451
00:25:25,840 --> 00:25:27,840
- I want to be... - The boss's wife?

452
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,560
You're better off dreaming.

453
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:32,879
I've seen plenty of these shameful tactics you're using.

454
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,440
If you have this much time and energy,

455
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:36,919
you should focus on your actual job.

456
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,840
I think you just don't want to work hard at all.

457
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,879
But I didn't know then...

458
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:47,480
that you did it for the Soar Initiative.

459
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:49,920
All of this was because of my arrogance.

460
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:54,040
And I didn't show you enough respect.

461
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,400
But I'm glad...

462
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,560
that through your own efforts,

463
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:00,920
you've become an excellent pilot.

464
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:03,560
If I had ruined someone's dream,

465
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,200
when I look back late at night,

466
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:10,000
I think I would feel deeply ashamed...

467
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,800
of my mistake.

468
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:15,080
But even if I had read your letter back then,

469
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:18,680
I'm sorry,

470
00:26:19,760 --> 00:26:20,760
the Soar Initiative...

471
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:23,080
would still have been canceled.

472
00:26:24,320 --> 00:26:25,920
Because Hengshi's pilots...

473
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:27,320
were facing overstaffing...

474
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,920
and aircraft model reforms.

475
00:26:29,520 --> 00:26:31,120
If we had continued the Soar Initiative,

476
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,920
it would have only accelerated layoffs at Hengshi.

477
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:39,280
It wouldn't have just been the end of a few people's dreams.

478
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:41,000
Many families would have had...

479
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,280
to bear the consequences...

480
00:26:43,800 --> 00:26:44,920
along with Hengshi.

481
00:26:49,120 --> 00:26:51,360
What do you mean by saying this now?

482
00:26:52,560 --> 00:26:54,960
Is this an apology convention?

483
00:26:56,560 --> 00:26:57,640
You just said we're even.

484
00:26:59,840 --> 00:27:02,080
I think I still owe you a formal apology.

485
00:27:05,120 --> 00:27:06,240
I can't let this one slap...

486
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,920
erase what I owe you.

487
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,360
I also hope that you...

488
00:27:13,320 --> 00:27:14,720
can forgive the person I was...

489
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:16,960
who was so vulgar and rude...

490
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:18,840
three years ago.

491
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,400
I've already moved on.

492
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:34,160
Then we're even.

493
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,960
He isn't waiting for me, is he?

494
00:28:17,320 --> 00:28:18,960
Ms. Ruan, what a coincidence.

495
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,160
It is.

496
00:28:31,320 --> 00:28:32,320
Did you call a car yet?

497
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,920
Not yet.

498
00:28:36,120 --> 00:28:38,600
Let's go, or we'll be late.

499
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,480
Thank you.

500
00:29:00,800 --> 00:29:01,800
Ms. Ruan,

501
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,840
are you really pursuing Mr. Fu?

502
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:08,600
Driver, please pull over.

503
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:09,880
Someone wants to get off.

504
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:12,560
But we're in the middle of nowhere.

505
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,440
How can you be like this?
This is just how I am.

506
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:16,760
Either that, or you shut up.

507
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:48,720
How did I get home?

508
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:01,120
Who should I ask?

509
00:30:02,600 --> 00:30:03,680
Fu Ming Yu?

510
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,000
I don't know how to explain it to him.

511
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:08,240
Ruan Si Xian?

512
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,799
Right after I finished badmouthing him,

513
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:13,280
Fu Ming Yu showed up at the bar.

514
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:14,960
Backstabber.

515
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,440
It will have to be you.

516
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:22,040
Xuan, I drank a bit too much last night.

517
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:23,920
Sorry for the trouble.

518
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:26,280
By the way, let me ask you something.

519
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:28,160
How did I get home?

520
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:36,520
Fu Ming Yu took you home.

521
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,720
I knew it.

522
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,880
Then after that, did anything happen with Ruan Si Xian?

523
00:30:46,480 --> 00:30:47,880
(Bian Xuan)

524
00:30:48,760 --> 00:30:49,760
Nothing much.

525
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,920
She just slapped Fu Ming Yu in the face.

526
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,960
As expected of a female pilot.

527
00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:01,680
She actually slapped him.

528
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:04,960
What a world we live in.

529
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:07,560
Just as I hoped.

530
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:11,040
An An, I'm coming in.

531
00:31:13,560 --> 00:31:15,559
Look at you. Why did you drink so much?

532
00:31:15,560 --> 00:31:16,560
You must have a headache.

533
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:18,439
Here. I made you some honey water.

534
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:19,480
Drink up.

535
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:22,320
But I have something to tell you.

536
00:31:22,760 --> 00:31:24,759
Do you remember that female pilot from Hengshi?

537
00:31:24,760 --> 00:31:26,120
The one I took photos of.

538
00:31:28,800 --> 00:31:30,480
I have a vague impression. What about her?

539
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:32,040
Last night,

540
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:35,160
she hit Fu Ming Yu.

541
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,680
She hit Fu Ming Yu?

542
00:31:37,760 --> 00:31:38,760
And...

543
00:31:39,760 --> 00:31:41,160
it was a slap in the face.

544
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:42,520
Why?

545
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,080
I was so drunk.

546
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,320
How would I know why?

547
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:48,320
But that guy Fu Ming Yu...

548
00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:49,680
had it coming.

549
00:31:49,840 --> 00:31:51,000
It's only natural to hit him.

550
00:31:53,040 --> 00:31:54,439
Don't worry too much.

551
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:56,760
He's a grown man. One slap won't kill him.

552
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:59,760
Last night, when he brought me back,

553
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:01,280
did you see his face?

554
00:32:01,520 --> 00:32:03,520
- Was it swollen? - He didn't bring you back.

555
00:32:03,560 --> 00:32:04,880
His chauffeur did.

556
00:32:05,800 --> 00:32:07,280
Then he deserved to be hit even more.

557
00:32:07,520 --> 00:32:08,520
I knew it.

558
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:10,080
How could he possibly bring me back?

559
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:14,360
I'm going to send Ms. Ruan...

560
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,080
a message of congratulations.

561
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:27,720
My dear Ms. Ruan, you're amazing!

562
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:29,840
This slap really vented my frustration.

563
00:32:30,280 --> 00:32:31,496
Sending this to congratulate you.

564
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:33,040
I'll treat you to a drink another day.

565
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:35,400
Drinking again?

566
00:32:35,600 --> 00:32:37,216
None of this would have happened without the alcohol.

567
00:32:37,240 --> 00:32:38,959
- And if it hadn't happened... - What do you mean?

568
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,760
- Am I not welcome here? - I wouldn't dare.

569
00:32:41,840 --> 00:32:43,136
I have a meeting with the Safety Committee later.

570
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,376
Mr. Fu takes it very seriously.

571
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,400
So I came over myself.

572
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,680
Captain Fan...

573
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:49,920
Is there any hope for Captain Fan's return?

574
00:32:50,040 --> 00:32:51,040
Who knows?

575
00:32:51,080 --> 00:32:52,480
The focus is on today's simulation.

576
00:32:52,600 --> 00:32:53,600
We'll just have to wait and see.

577
00:32:53,601 --> 00:32:54,839
- Okay, I'll let you get back to it. - Okay.

578
00:32:54,840 --> 00:32:55,840
Go ahead.

579
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,800
That's why I'm telling you,

580
00:32:57,880 --> 00:33:00,280
from now on, the data must be verified.

581
00:33:01,120 --> 00:33:02,120
Let's go.

582
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,520
What is this now?

583
00:33:13,040 --> 00:33:14,160
Can't you tell?

584
00:33:14,840 --> 00:33:15,840
It's my workstation.

585
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,480
A massage chair.

586
00:33:18,080 --> 00:33:19,080
Young Master,

587
00:33:19,081 --> 00:33:20,521
did you come to my studio to retire?

588
00:33:20,760 --> 00:33:22,160
Think about it from my perspective.

589
00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:25,120
How many days of hard labor have I done for you?

590
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:26,776
Shouldn't I at least sit comfortably?

591
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:28,720
Then should I prepare a fruit platter for you,

592
00:33:29,040 --> 00:33:30,040
along with some tea?

593
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:32,480
Maybe I should hire two people to wait on you.

594
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,040
No need.

595
00:33:34,360 --> 00:33:35,520
I have all of those things...

596
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:36,600
back at Bo'ao.

597
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:38,720
But seriously,

598
00:33:39,080 --> 00:33:41,079
do you have any employee benefits here?

599
00:33:41,080 --> 00:33:43,200
Like, for example, team-building activities.

600
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:46,080
I've been under a lot of pressure lately.

601
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:47,880
I really need to go out and relax.

602
00:33:48,120 --> 00:33:49,279
I haven't even opened for business yet,

603
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:50,720
and you're asking for team building?

604
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:52,520
Are you here to reform the workplace?

605
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:55,600
I'm not joking.

606
00:33:57,000 --> 00:33:58,000
I'll take you to Ma'ao.

607
00:33:58,001 --> 00:33:59,239
I'm not joking either.

608
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:00,600
With my studio in this state...

609
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,479
and the situation at home,

610
00:34:02,480 --> 00:34:03,480
how heartless do you think I am...
to go on a trip with you?

611
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:05,760
I'll cover all the expenses.

612
00:34:07,040 --> 00:34:08,400
That must include flights, hotels,

613
00:34:08,560 --> 00:34:09,560
and shopping.
A one-stop service.

614
00:34:12,720 --> 00:34:14,440
It's not like I can't consider it.

615
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:17,560
But it has to be after my parents' wedding anniversary.

616
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:20,360
It's mainly for our team's cohesion.

617
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,680
Sir, the massage chair has been installed. Please sign here.

618
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:26,600
- Done. - Thank you.

619
00:34:29,480 --> 00:34:32,040
Why do I feel like with you in this studio,

620
00:34:32,680 --> 00:34:33,880
it'll go bust sooner or later?

621
00:34:35,160 --> 00:34:36,360
Let me tell you, Zheng You An.

622
00:34:36,520 --> 00:34:39,040
This studio of yours won't go bust precisely because I'm here.

623
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,640
Life is only 30,000 days long.

624
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:43,400
Shouldn't I make myself comfortable?

625
00:34:46,200 --> 00:34:48,480
Today, the emergency we're simulating is...

626
00:34:48,680 --> 00:34:50,720
based on Hengshi Flight 2076,

627
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:53,160
on which a passenger suffered a sudden heart attack.

628
00:34:53,520 --> 00:34:55,240
The flight has to land within 15 minutes...

629
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:57,160
to ensure the passenger receives timely care.

630
00:34:58,040 --> 00:35:00,160
Four simulators will set four different decisions.

631
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:01,960
Simulator 1 is Captain Fan.

632
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:05,160
She will maintain the flight condition of that day,

633
00:35:05,520 --> 00:35:07,296
with a bank angle of no more than 45 degrees.

634
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:09,520
Simulator 2 will avoid an overweight landing...

635
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:10,760
by circling to burn fuel.

636
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:13,800
Simulator 3 will remain on autopilot.

637
00:35:14,520 --> 00:35:16,480
The subsequent decision is an overweight landing.

638
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:19,280
Simulator 4 will also disconnect the autopilot,

639
00:35:19,520 --> 00:35:20,920
matching Captain Fan's decision.

640
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:23,000
Then we can begin.

641
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,560
Jiangcheng, Hengshi 2076.

642
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,679
Hengshi 2076, go ahead.

643
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:31,279
We have a passenger who fainted on board.

644
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:33,359
The medical personnel on board are doing their best to treat them.

645
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,760
They need immediate emergency care.

646
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,600
Requesting radar guidance for return.

647
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:38,520
Contact our base and relevant departments.

648
00:35:38,560 --> 00:35:40,000
Hengshi 2076, roger that.

649
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:41,879
Radar guidance. Turn right heading 210.

650
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:43,120
Descend 42.

651
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:45,480
Descend 42.

652
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:49,759
(Simulator 1: Disconnect autopilot, Bank angle up to 45 degrees)

653
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:51,200
(Stable flight condition)

654
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:53,440
We are currently overweight.

655
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:55,399
Estimated circling time to burn fuel is 30 minutes.

656
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,976
(Simulator 2: Stay on autopilot, Circle to burn fuel)

657
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,280
We'll maintain autopilot.

658
00:35:58,680 --> 00:35:59,960
Maximum bank angle 30 degrees.

659
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:01,440
Simulator 4.

660
00:36:01,441 --> 00:36:02,760
Disconnecting autopilot now.

661
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:05,080
Maintaining a bank angle of no more than 45 degrees.

662
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:14,320
Next, the four captains begin their landings.

663
00:36:16,160 --> 00:36:17,600
Simulator 1, preparing to land.

664
00:36:18,560 --> 00:36:19,560
One hundred.

665
00:36:26,080 --> 00:36:27,080
Forty.
Thirty.

666
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:29,200
Twenty.
Ten.

667
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:34,079
(Simulator 1: Time spent: 9 minutes, 45 seconds)

668
00:36:34,080 --> 00:36:35,279
(No warnings triggered)

669
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,640
Simulator 1 has landed.

670
00:36:50,200 --> 00:36:51,440
Simulator 4, preparing to land.

671
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,359
(Simulator 4: Time spent: 11 minutes, 21 seconds)

672
00:36:58,360 --> 00:36:59,360
(Unstable flight condition)

673
00:36:59,361 --> 00:37:00,800
Simulator 4 has landed.

674
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,656
Simulator 3, preparing to land.

675
00:37:18,680 --> 00:37:19,680
Fifty.

676
00:37:19,720 --> 00:37:20,720
Forty.

677
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:21,800
Thirty.
Twenty.

678
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:23,800
Ten.

679
00:37:23,801 --> 00:37:24,839
(Simulator 3: Time spent: 15 minutes, 15 seconds)

680
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,840
(Triggered QAR710 hard landing warning)

681
00:37:25,841 --> 00:37:27,120
Simulator 3 has landed.

682
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:29,600
Simulator 2,

683
00:37:29,601 --> 00:37:30,881
estimated landing in 15 minutes.

684
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:54,799
Simulator 2 has landed.

685
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:56,759
(Simulator 2: Time spent: 31 minutes, 45 seconds)

686
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:58,040
(No warnings triggered)

687
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:06,640
All four simulator crews have completed their landings.

688
00:38:07,160 --> 00:38:08,200
It's easy to see that...

689
00:38:09,080 --> 00:38:11,400
Simulator 2, to avoid an overweight landing,

690
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:12,880
chose to circle and burn fuel,

691
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:15,159
extending the landing time...

692
00:38:15,160 --> 00:38:16,440
to 31 minutes and 45 seconds.

693
00:38:16,840 --> 00:38:18,536
This is much longer than Captain Fan's time,

694
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:21,016
costing the passenger precious time to receive medical treatment.

695
00:38:21,040 --> 00:38:22,040
Simulator 3,

696
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:24,120
during an overweight landing,

697
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:26,760
failed to effectively control the aircraft's rate of descent,

698
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:29,000
triggering a QAR hard landing warning.

699
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,080
The time taken was slightly over 15 minutes.

700
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:34,600
Simulator 4 made the same decision as Captain Fan.

701
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:36,240
They disconnected the autopilot...

702
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:37,719
and kept the bank angle...

703
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:40,160
within the CAAC standard of 45 degrees.

704
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:41,840
Although they landed successfully,

705
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:44,120
the fuselage was severely unstable,

706
00:38:44,640 --> 00:38:46,039
and the time was 1 minute and 36 seconds...

707
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:47,360
longer than Captain Fan's.

708
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:50,760
As for Captain Fan's flight data and performance,

709
00:38:51,040 --> 00:38:53,520
I believe everyone here has seen it for themselves,

710
00:38:53,640 --> 00:38:54,800
so I won't elaborate further.

711
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:58,920
Look.

712
00:39:00,120 --> 00:39:02,120
To save everyone's time,

713
00:39:02,160 --> 00:39:04,680
I have three other sets of experimental data here.

714
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:06,160
These three sets of data...

715
00:39:06,240 --> 00:39:07,680
are from simulation replays...

716
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:09,440
based on the same emergency.

717
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:12,080
All the flight data is right here.

718
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:15,216
The mission for these three simulators...

719
00:39:15,240 --> 00:39:17,080
was to absolutely avoid triggering the QAR.

720
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:18,616
So, to avoid a heavy landing,

721
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:20,000
the three captains either chose...

722
00:39:20,120 --> 00:39:22,040
to circle and burn fuel...

723
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:24,280
or to remain on autopilot.

724
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:26,759
But without exception, they all exceeded...

725
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:28,360
the 15-minute requirement for diversion.

726
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:30,120
At the same time, they missed...

727
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,840
the patient's golden hour for rescue.

728
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:33,960
Aside from the other results,

729
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:36,680
the only captain to have landed within 15 minutes today...

730
00:39:37,160 --> 00:39:38,256
still had a time difference...

731
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:40,480
of 1 minute and 36 seconds compared to Captain Fan Lei.

732
00:39:41,600 --> 00:39:42,640
One minute and 36 seconds.

733
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:45,000
A seemingly insignificant margin,

734
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:46,760
but it's highly likely...

735
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:48,600
to be the window between life and death.

736
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:51,600
Fortunately, however, this patient...

737
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:53,320
received timely treatment that day...

738
00:39:53,680 --> 00:39:55,280
and is now recovering at home.

739
00:39:59,640 --> 00:40:01,519
(To the SH2076 crew for their skill in crisis and heartwarming service)

740
00:40:01,520 --> 00:40:03,320
(Presented by Ms. Xu, a Jiangcheng passenger)

741
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:04,360
This banner...

742
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:07,120
is the passenger's recognition and commendation...

743
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,320
for our entire crew.

744
00:40:29,520 --> 00:40:30,600
Our crew members...

745
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:31,840
used their expertise...

746
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:34,360
not only to save a life,

747
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:36,840
but also a family's future.

748
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,440
They ensured the safety...

749
00:40:38,441 --> 00:40:40,200
of the passengers' lives and property.

750
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:43,520
At the same time, they prevented a serious accident from occurring.

751
00:40:46,200 --> 00:40:48,520
If we ground a captain like this,

752
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:50,680
it will be a loss for all of Hengshi.

753
00:40:53,680 --> 00:40:55,520
This emergency also reminded us...

754
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:57,520
that the QAR...

755
00:40:57,521 --> 00:41:00,040
shouldn't be the only measure of flight quality.

756
00:41:01,280 --> 00:41:02,879
The reform of the QAR standards...

757
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:04,040
is imperative.

758
00:41:22,200 --> 00:41:24,319
(After deliberation, the Hengshi Air Safety Committee has decided...)

759
00:41:24,320 --> 00:41:26,080
(to lift Fan Lei's grounded status.)

760
00:41:29,600 --> 00:41:31,760
(Jiangcheng International Airport)

761
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:37,400
Can I help you?

762
00:41:37,720 --> 00:41:38,720
Ms. Ruan,

763
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,560
you seem like a decent person.

764
00:41:42,520 --> 00:41:44,720
You helped Captain Fan regain her flying status, right?

765
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:48,296
Does my mentor have her flying status back?

766
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,320
You didn't know?

767
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:51,840
I thought you asked Mr. Fu for help.

768
00:42:18,920 --> 00:42:19,920
Mom.

769
00:42:20,680 --> 00:42:21,680
You're back.

770
00:42:22,080 --> 00:42:23,840
Why are you standing there? Come here.

771
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:31,840
You asked me to come back.

772
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,160
Is there something you need?

773
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:35,120
Why are you wearing a mask this late at night?

774
00:42:36,040 --> 00:42:37,760
I'm having an allergic reaction on my face.

775
00:42:40,240 --> 00:42:41,240
Here's the thing.

776
00:42:42,080 --> 00:42:43,279
Mr. Zheng and his wife...

777
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:44,960
are celebrating their wedding anniversary.

778
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:46,320
They've invited us.

779
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:48,680
I thought if it were anyone else, I'd just skip it.

780
00:42:49,080 --> 00:42:51,000
But they invited our whole family.

781
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:53,920
If only your dad and I go, it wouldn't seem right.

782
00:42:55,360 --> 00:42:58,000
But can you go in your condition?

783
00:42:59,160 --> 00:43:00,160
I can. It's no problem.

784
00:43:00,320 --> 00:43:01,760
- Is it serious? - No, not at all.

785
00:43:02,160 --> 00:43:03,480
Take off the mask and let me see.

786
00:43:03,960 --> 00:43:04,960
No, I had better keep it on.

787
00:43:04,961 --> 00:43:06,040
- Let me see. - Mom.

788
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:07,440
Let me look.

789
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:08,839
I'm fine. I'm totally fine.

790
00:43:08,840 --> 00:43:11,400
I've already applied the medicine. I don't want you to catch it.

791
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:14,280
By the way,

792
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:16,199
I saw that pearl necklace of yours.

793
00:43:16,200 --> 00:43:17,976
It has been sitting there for several days now.

794
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:19,360
Why haven't you given it away yet?

795
00:43:20,080 --> 00:43:21,080
This is perfect timing.

796
00:43:21,081 --> 00:43:22,960
You can give it to Mrs. Zheng.

797
00:43:24,640 --> 00:43:25,640
All right.

798
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:27,200
I wonder if Ms. Dong...

799
00:43:27,400 --> 00:43:29,520
would even care for such material items.

800
00:43:30,680 --> 00:43:33,360
I just don't get it. Look, it's a second marriage.

801
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:35,440
What's there to celebrate?

802
00:43:36,360 --> 00:43:37,360
To be honest,

803
00:43:37,480 --> 00:43:38,760
I don't even want you to go.

804
00:43:39,640 --> 00:43:40,640
It's bad luck.

805
00:43:41,400 --> 00:43:42,839
Mom, it's getting late.

806
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:44,640
You should get some rest. I'll head back now.

807
00:43:45,480 --> 00:43:47,000
- Head back where? - Back to Mingchen.

808
00:43:49,080 --> 00:43:50,599
What's so good about Mingchen?

809
00:43:50,600 --> 00:43:52,240
You don't even want to come home anymore.

810
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:59,960
(Departing Ep. 9 for Ep. 10)
